er."},"processFee()":{"details":"takes fee based on new interest accumulated since the last time the function was called"},"proxiableUUID()":{"details":"Implementation of the ERC1822 {proxiableUUID} function. This returns the storage slot used by the implementation. It is used to validate the implementation's compatibility when performing an upgrade. IMPORTANT: A proxy pointing at a proxiable contract should not be considered proxiable itself, because this risks bricking a proxy that upgrades to it, by delegating to itself until out of gas. Thus it is critical that this function revert if invoked through a proxy. This is guaranteed by the `notDelegated` modifier."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setAllowlist(address)":{"params":{"_allowlist":"is the address of the new allowlist contract"}},"setFeeRecipient(address)":{"params":{"_feeRecipient":"is the address of the new fee recipient"}},"setManagementFee(uint256)":{"params":{"_managementFee":"is the management fee (18 decimals). ex: 2 * 10 ** 18 = 2%"}},"setMinter(address)":{"params":{"_minter":"is the address of the new minter"}},"setOracle(address)":{"details":"used to fetch interest accrued for calculating fee","params":{"_oracle":"is the address"}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"upgradeTo(address)":{"details":"Upgrade the implementation of the proxy to `newImplementation`. Calls {_authorizeUpgrade}. Emits an {Upgraded} event."},"upgradeToAndCall(address,bytes)":{"details":"Upgrade the implementation of the proxy to `newImplementation`, and subsequently execute the function call encoded in `data`. Calls {_authorizeUpgrade}. Emits an {Upgraded} event."}},"title":"ShortDurationYieldCoin","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"allowlist()":{"notice":"allowlist manager to check permissions"},"cachedTotalInterest()":{"notice":"previously recorded total interest accrued"},"feeRecipient()":{"notice":"the address that receives the management fee"},"managementFee()":{"notice":"management fee charged on accrued interest"},"minter()":{"notice":"the address that is able to mint new tokens"},"oracle()":{"notice":"the address of the token oracle"},"processFee()":{"notice":"Processes fees based on accrued interest"},"setAllowlist(address)":{"notice":"Sets the allowlist contract"},"setFeeRecipient(address)":{"notice":"Sets the new fee recipient"},"setManagementFee(uint256)":{"notice":"Sets the management fee for the token"},"setMinter(address)":{"notice":"Sets the minter role"},"setOracle(address)":{"notice":"Sets the oracle for the token"}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"src/core/coins/ShortDurationYieldCoin.sol":"ShortDurationYieldCoin"},"evmVersion":"london","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":100000},"remappings":[":ds-test/=lib/forge-std/lib/ds-test/src/",":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/",":openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/",":openzeppelin-contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/",":openzeppelin-upgradeable/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/contracts/",":openzeppelin/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/",":solmate/=lib/solmate/src/"]},"sources":{"lib/openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/contracts/access/OwnableUpgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x247c62047745915c0af6b955470a72d1696ebad4352d7d3011aef1a2463cd888","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://d7fc8396619de513c96b6e00301b88dd790e83542aab918425633a5f7297a15a","dweb:/ipfs/QmXbP4kiZyp7guuS7xe8KaybnwkRPGrBc2Kbi3vhcTfpxb"]},"lib/openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/contracts/proxy/utils/Initializable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x037c